[Issues](https://github.com/Korhii/MI-HDR-Control/issues), [Discussions](https://github.com/Korhii/MI-HDR-Control/discussions) and pull requests are open for feedback, discussion and proposed changes. Replies, maintenance, updates, fixes and merges are not promised.

